Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:01.78,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}ko wo agete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Raise your fist{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Big Mom is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.48,0:02:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bring me 100 percent pure\NSea Prism Stone cuffs and chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do something more!\NInject 100 shots of tranquilizer for savage animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's take the old bag to Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.04,0:02:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:03:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Advance at full speed! To Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.31,0:03:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wish Big Mom and the balloon\Nwere still here to fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah. He freed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've always been free!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Tell them everything, straw hat kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That there is still hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That there is one last chance\Nto take down Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a beast that's held in that cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"If we keep feeding him fish\Nthat are contaminated with industrial wastewater, he'll die."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.39,0:03:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0} ordered 13 years ago,\Nhe meant it as an execution...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We couldn't disobey Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s order,\Nso we kept him alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but he should have been executed\Nbefore anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.11,0:04:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that cell, we're holding...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...a member of the Akazaya Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"Start Fighting Back!\NLuffy and the Akazaya Samurai!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.87,0:04:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There he is! That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:04:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're the man with the big face!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.09,0:05:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,SOLITAIRE - A VICE WARDEN (A HEADLINER)\NEXCAVATION LABOR CAMP, MONKEY SMILE FRUIT
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.72,0:05:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Solitaire-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.31,0:05:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You bastard! Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you stole the keys\Nto the Sea Prism Stone cuffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.19,0:05:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The truth is shrouded in mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.37,0:05:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll shred you to pieces and unseal your lips!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you're a legendary samurai,\Nyou're no better than a baby with those cuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, be careful.\NHe might be hiding something more...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?\NIf you have something, use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--I guess you ran out of fishbones...\N--Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.78,0:06:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so damn agile!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're using six swords,\Nso here's what I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ninpo: Shadow Clone Jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Nin{\i0}, {\i1}nin{\i0}, {\i1}nin{\i0}!\NCan you guess which one is the real me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how many there are,\NI'll cut them all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I beat the Shadow Clone Jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice try!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, I must be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ninpo: Smoke Escape Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.08,0:07:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did he go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.63,0:07:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--H-He is...\N--What should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Babanuki-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s orders are clear.\NWe should kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:01.57,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,NINPO
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ninpo: Flying Squirrel Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.57,0:08:04.02,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,FLYING SQUIRREL TECHNIQUE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The intruder got out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.82,0:08:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let him get away! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.57,0:08:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here is the key to the cuffs\Nand your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.21,0:08:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just in time, Raizo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.89,0:08:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I missed it so much...\NMy precious sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sotomuso!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You men...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like sumo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawamatsu-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.67,0:09:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yagura Ryuo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If your feet leave the ground,\Nyou lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You are still very strong, Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like swimming in the rapids of a great river!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,People call it Kappa Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:09:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,River of Retribution!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,RIVER OF RETRIBUTION
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were the poisonous fish delicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, their awful taste made me want to vomit\Nand they ruined my stomach...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I stayed alive for 13 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In comparison to my lord's disappointment,\Nwhatever pain I felt paled!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have been waiting all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawamatsu the Kappa has just joined the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.38,0:10:41.64,DefaultLow,,0000,0000,0000,,YOKOZUNA KAWAMATSU\NA VASSAL OF THE KOZUKI CLAN
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawamatsu-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have not changed a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.48,0:10:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am so happy to see you again alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.23,0:10:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Raizo! You, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiku! When did you get here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:11:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?!\NWho's that guy with a giant face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's an intruder!\NHe stole the keys to the cuffs and the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Don't just stand there!\NCatch them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you guys come back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.31,0:11:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawamatsu-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.89,0:11:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am sorry...\NI feel like throwing up everything that I had the last 13 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get the Plague Rounds ready!\NWe've got to finish them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.11,0:11:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, prepare to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Count on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you guys ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Go away! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave Luffytaro-{\i1}san{\i0} alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Otherwise, we must fight you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's you guys who should leave us alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.23,0:12:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get us involved!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we're pathetic or go hungry,\Nwe can live on as long as we submit to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guys! Is that really what you want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.95,0:12:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiku! Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,HYO
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Don't tell me you're Boss Hyogoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh... Anyway, Kiku and Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let everyone know who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.51,0:12:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There are people who got their spirits broken and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.82,0:12:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,people who actually fought and have been beaten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to encourage them,\Nyou must take off those cloth face coverings!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hyogoro-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.11,0:13:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.90,0:13:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We must win their trust first!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we do not reveal our identities,\Nwe are no more than ghosts...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way... That mask...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought he died at Oden Castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The most beautiful swordsman\Nin the Land of Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kikunojo of the Fallen Snow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Are you a man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:13:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am a woman at heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That mask is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.21,0:14:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Fukurokuju's rival ninja,\NRaizo of the Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And he's a samurai and the most formidable\Nsumo wrestler ever, Yokozuna Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And that old man next to them\Nreally is who we thought! The real Hyogoro the Flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.36,0:14:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,who is Luffytaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, they're all amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! What about me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you guys died 20 years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We dare say...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We are alive like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, you're really...\Nreally the Akazaya samurai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.72,0:14:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, as you can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:15:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll save you at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.64,0:15:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Trust us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh! Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is exactly like Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s absurd story!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We must let Kaido-{\i1}sama{\i0} know somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that you've seen us,\Nwe need you to keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He must be Fukurokuju's underling!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he'll ever stop following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.71,0:17:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know. That guy's so pesky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'll get him next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.37,0:18:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How's the old bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir! Thanks to the tranquilizers,\Nshe's sleeping like the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good! If we can take her to Kaido-{\i1}sama{\i0},\Neverything will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W... What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! We injected 100 shots of\Ntranquilizer for use against savage animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She woke up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Such gracious hospitality!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.75,0:18:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, stop running!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bring me red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:19:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The red-bean soup is all mine!\NWhy would I wanna give it to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you fell asleep again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:19.07,DefaultLow,,0000,0000,0000,,EXCAVATION LABOR CAMP, UDON
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.29,0:19:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ninpo: Flower Shuriken!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heavy Gong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Gatling!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.57,0:20:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take the Plague Rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.46,0:20:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Plague Rounds aren't hitting him!\NDaifugo-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.84,0:20:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot! I told you that it doesn't matter who they hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How could those bastards do that\Nto the starving prisoners!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't forgive them\Nfor using a virus as a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.75,0:20:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no! I won't let you get in\NDaifugo-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Let's do it, Chopper!\N--Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.17,0:21:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heavy Stamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave my allies alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kappa Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yorikiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ninpo: Lightning Shuriken!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.42,0:22:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Use it! Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}'s friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.34,0:22:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Friend... you said?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.18,0:22:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One of them should be the right key!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.73,0:22:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't take them off without your help...\NGive me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.28,0:22:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or do you wanna laugh to death here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.41,0:22:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You actually recognize me now,\Ndon't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.91,0:22:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get up. Uncuff me using those keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.31,0:23:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It can't get any worse!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The random shooting of the Plague Rounds continues\Nand all hell breaks loose in the Labor Camp.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.94,0:23:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even after being infected,\NLuffy risks his life trying to stop the prisoners' riot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.61,0:23:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}He must awaken their fighting spirits!\NLuffy's holler for victory echoes across the Land of Wano!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.49,0:23:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"We're Here to Win! Luffy's Desperate Scream!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:48.42,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
